Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf91": "<h2 id=\"第-91-法-虎临干鬼凶速速-凶祸必速\">第 91 法　虎临干鬼凶速速：凶祸必速</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　伤干容改，伤支主败</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎临干鬼格-凶祸速至\">虎临干鬼格：凶祸速至</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干之鬼上乘白虎者，凡占凶祸速中又速。如六己日卯加未夜占，六壬日戌加亥昼夜占，六癸日戌加癸昼占，此三干皆虎鬼临干者。唯宜详其虎鬼或空亡，或鬼坐鬼方，或坐生方，及虎之阴神能制虎者，虽目前值其灾祸，后却无患也。其余虎鬼无制不空等，占讼被刑，占病作死气必死，所占万事祸不可逃。唯有官人占赴任，却名催官符，赴任极速，反不宜受制及空。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 91 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼乘白虎，凶祸最速。若虎鬼空亡、坐受制之方、坐长生，或白虎阴神制虎，则眼前虽惊，后患可解；无制不空则病讼诸占多凶，官人赴任反为催官。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己巳日　月将 寅 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：虎临干鬼格 · 己巳日第5局昼占（据书图三传卯亥未注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"马载虎鬼格-凶祸尤速\">马载虎鬼格：凶祸尤速</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">马载虎鬼格，乃虎鬼作日之驿马是也。凶祸尤速。占讼必得罪于远方极妙。如戊辰日夜将，得寅加未作末传，寅却乘白虎，又是驿马。又戊辰日寅加酉夜，戊戌日寅加亥夜，戊子日寅加未夜，甲寅日申加午昼，甲寅日伏吟昼，甲寅日申加戌昼，甲午日申加午昼。甲戌、戊申二日虽有，因虎鬼空亡，不足论也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 91 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼乘白虎又作驿马，为马载虎鬼，凶祸更速。占讼多应远方得罪；若虎鬼空亡，则不以此论。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊辰日　月将 辰 加占时 酉　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 未 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：马载虎鬼格 · 戊辰日第6局夜占（据书图三传子未寅注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：日干之鬼上乘白虎，凶祸速中又速</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干之鬼上乘白虎。</p>\n<p>⭐ 凶祸速中又速；虎鬼无制不空则占讼被刑、占病死。虎之阴神能制虎则病者愈。官人则名催官符。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔疾病墓虎〕</span>虎鬼临干：白虎乘日鬼临干，病伤官灾直逼其身，应速。　<strong>用法</strong>：再并旬丁则凶动更急；虎鬼空亡、被制可减。</p>\n<hr>", "bf92": "<h2 id=\"第-92-法-龙加生气吉迟迟-福吉缓至\">第 92 法　龙加生气吉迟迟：福吉缓至</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　君子欲施恩而未启齿</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"龙加生气格-慢慢成福\">龙加生气格：慢慢成福</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓青龙乘生干之神，又作月内之生气者。虽目下未足峥嵘，却徐徐而发福也。此例喻君子欲施恩于人，未尝启齿，缓而作吉，尤赖岁君。如六丙日寅加巳夜将乘青龙，三月占尤的。六丁日干上寅夜将，三月占，内丙午、丁未日空亡不中用。六戊日干上申昼将乘青龙，九月占，内戊寅日申空。六己日干上巳昼将，六月占，内己亥日巳空。余干无例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 92 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　青龙乘生干之神，又作月内生气，主福吉缓缓而来，眼前未显，日后渐成。若生气空亡，则不用此断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙申日　月将 午 加占时 酉　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：龙加生气格 · 六丙日寅加巳夜将乘青龙，三月占 · 丙申日第4局夜占（据原文例课三传巳寅亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：青龙乘生神又作月生气，徐徐发福</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　青龙乘生干之神、又作月内之生气。</p>\n<p>⭐ 目下未足峥嵘、徐徐发福；喻君子施惠于人，缓而作吉。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔吉应迟速〕</span>龙加生气：青龙乘生气，吉意有根而缓慢生长，不主立刻到来。　<strong>用法</strong>：求财婚喜可断迟得稳得；若生气空破，则迟而不至。</p>\n<hr>", "bf93": "<h2 id=\"第-93-法-妄用三传灾福异-三传起用辨误\">第 93 法　妄用三传灾福异：三传起用辨误</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　三传错误则灾福不验</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"妄用三传格-占断错误\">妄用三传格：占断错误</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">时人起三传尚有错误，想灾福应无的验也。且问三传错误者何？辛酉日干上亥，既是辛日，岂可便以亥加戌为初传乎。又如乙酉日亥加辰，既是乙日，岂可便以亥加辰为初传乎。乙巳日干上卯，既是乙日，岂可便以卯加辰为初传乎。又如甲戌日干上戌，时人各以戌加寅涉害为用，三传戌午寅皆作脱气，凡占谋用无成，有忧皆散，殊不知当取子加戌为用，非涉害也。起用一误，灾福吉凶遂异。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 93 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传起用若错，吉凶全错。书中举辛酉、乙酉、乙巳、甲戌等例，说明不能见克便妄取涉害，须按正法定初传。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：起三传若误则应验无准，须辨涉害比和</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　起三传若取用有误。</p>\n<p>⭐ 则灾福应验无准；须辨涉害与比和、慎取发用，不可一概而论。</p>\n<hr>", "bf94": "<h2 id=\"第-94-法-喜惧空亡乃妙机-详辨空亡\">第 94 法　喜惧空亡乃妙机：详辨空亡</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　强敌宜落空亡</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"空亡分类格-要与不要\">空亡分类格：要与不要</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">凡空亡有要见，有不要见者，后学不察，一例而言之，诚为可叹。盖天盘作空亡者，谓之游行空亡，其吉凶有七八分；地盘作空亡者，谓之落底空亡，其吉凶有十分。克、盗、墓神及神遥克日，以上皆要空亡。惟生我者及救神并天德、生气、财官及日遥克神，并不宜空亡，否则反为凶兆。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　空亡有该空与不该空。克我、盗气、墓神等凶忌宜空；生我、救神、天德、生气、财官等喜用不宜空。天盘空为游行空，地盘空为落底空。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"见生不生格-父母病死\">见生不生格：父母病死</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">见生不生格，甲乙日以亥为生，其亥水居申上，他自恋生，不来生我；或是亥水居辰戌丑未之上，为土所制，纵日辰行年上见之，亦不能生我。至于亥入空亡则大凶。如生我者空亡，占父母上人病主不救。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　长生虽见，若恋生、受克或空亡，则不能生我。占父母尊长病，生神空亡多凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日　月将 酉 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>巳→申→亥</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>申→亥→寅</strong>（重审；分歧类型：<strong>取下神</strong>）。 原书注：见生不生格 · 甲子日第10局昼占（据书图三传巳申亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"见克不克格-鬼不能害\">见克不克格：鬼不能害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">见克不克格，如甲乙日以申酉为克，其金居巳午火上，他自受克，何暇克我。又申酉坐辰戌丑未上，他自恋生，亦不来克我。鬼陷空亡，亦不能为害。惟鬼作空亡加日辰、传、年命上，无制伏者极凶，或失人口，或犯官司，费用百出。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼若受克、贪生或陷空，则不能害我；但鬼空而临身命传上且无制，反主失人、官司、破耗。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙卯日　月将 酉 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 子 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>巳→申→亥</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>酉→子→卯</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：见克不克格 · 乙卯日第10局昼占（据书图三传巳申亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"见财无财格-反耗钱财\">见财无财格：反耗钱财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">见财无财格，如甲乙日以辰戌丑未为财，其财居寅卯上，不可取财也。或财作空亡，虽得，反有所费。财陷空亡亦不得，尤费财。如财居申酉脱气之上，反有所费。十干仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　财神若居受克、脱气或空亡之地，则见财无财，求财反费。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊辰日　月将 申 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 戌 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>辰→午→申</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>申→戌→子</strong>（重审；分歧类型：<strong>待查</strong>）。 原书注：见财无财格 · 戊辰日第11局昼占（据书图三传辰午申注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"见救不救格-反成灾害\">见救不救格：反成灾害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">见救不救格，如甲乙日传内先有申酉金，于日辰上见巳午火乃为救神。其巳午火居亥子上，或作空亡，或陷空亡，或在寅卯上自恋其生，此不能为救也，如此反为灾害。如不见日鬼，其救神即盗神也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　救神若受克、空亡或贪生，不能救灾，反成灾害；无鬼可救时，救神又可能变成盗气。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日　月将 子 加占时 午　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>午→子→午</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>寅→申→寅</strong>（返吟；分歧类型：<strong>待查</strong>）。 原书注：见救不救格 · 甲子日第7局昼占（据书图三传午子午注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"见盗不盗格-反变成吉\">见盗不盗格：反变成吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">见盗不盗格，如甲乙日见巳午火居亥子之乡，或入空亡之内，皆是盗我之气不得也，反变成吉。十干日同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　盗气若受克或入空，不能盗我，反作吉论。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙丑日　月将 子 加占时 午　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 辰 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>辰→戌→辰</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>戌→辰→戌</strong>（返吟；分歧类型：<strong>取下神</strong>）。 原书注：见盗不盗格 · 乙丑日第7局昼占（据书图三传辰戌辰注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"德贵合局生身格-逢克不吉\">德贵合局生身格：逢克不吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">德贵合局生身格，亦贵德临身消除祸患格。如乙酉日干上申，昼占，虽三传水局生日，缘天将昼夜皆贵勾常土神，使水局不能生其乙木。如用夜贵，尚有贵人临本身，犹能勉强倚贵而求生计。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　德神、贵人、合局生日本可解祸；若所乘天将反克合局，则生身之力被夺，不可作全吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙酉日　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 子 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：德贵合局生身格 · 乙酉日第9局昼占（据书图三传申子辰注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"长上灾凶格-占事不吉\">长上灾凶格：占事不吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">长上灾凶格，乃长生空亡之例。戊寅日申为长生作空亡，庚子日巳为长生作空亡，壬午日申为长生作空亡，甲子日亥为长生作空亡，丙午日寅为长生作空亡。月内生气亦忌空亡。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　长生或月内生气空亡，主尊长、生计、恩惠不实，占事多不吉。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"喜惧格-一喜一惧\">喜惧格：一喜一惧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">喜惧格，一则以喜，一则以惧之例，谓干上长生，三传皆鬼。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 94 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上长生为喜，三传皆鬼为惧，喜惧并见，须分轻重旺衰断。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：凶神宜空、吉神忌空，空亡喜惧是断课妙机</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　空亡分游行（天盘七八分）、落底（地盘十分）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 克盗墓神、遥克日者宜空；生我救神、德合财官忌空。见生不生/见克不克/见财无财/见救不救/见盗不盗五格皆本此。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔空亡虚实〕</span>喜惧空亡：所喜之类神忌空，所惧之凶神喜空，空亡没有固定吉凶。　<strong>用法</strong>：求财忌财空，占病喜鬼空；出空填实时吉凶可重新发动。</p>\n<hr>", "bf95": "<h2 id=\"第-95-法-六爻现卦防其克-六亲现卦\">第 95 法　六爻现卦防其克：六亲现卦</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占类现卦，须防所克</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"财爻现卦-父母有忧\">财爻现卦：父母有忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财爻现卦，必忧父母。歌云：三传俱作日之财，得此须忧长上灾，年命日辰乘干鬼，争知此类不为灾。如辛未日干上午，三传卯亥未木局，三传皆作日之财，虽忧父母，赖干上先有午火生其父母爻，窃其财爻，此名传财化鬼。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　财克父母，财爻现于课传而又见父母类，主父母尊长有忧；若有化泄制救，则不为灾。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛未日　月将 寅 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财爻现卦 · 辛未日第5局昼占（据书图三传卯亥未注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"父母爻现卦-子孙有忧\">父母爻现卦：子孙有忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">父母爻现卦，必忧子息。歌云：父母现卦子孙忧，日辰年命细参求，同类比肩居在上，儿孙昌盛不为仇。如戊寅日干上丑，三传戌午寅火局，皆作父母爻，虽忧子息，赖干上先有丑土生其子息，窃其父母。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　父母克子孙，父母爻旺而子孙见课，主子息有忧；若有同类化泄或财制父母，则无妨。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊寅日　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：父母爻现卦 · 戊寅日第5局昼占（据书图三传戌午寅注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"子息爻现卦-丢官退职\">子息爻现卦：丢官退职</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">子息爻现卦，必忧官事。歌云：子息显时官事无，古法流传实不诬，岂知四处财爻现，官迁讼罪病难苏。己巳日干上亥，三传酉丑巳金局皆作子息爻，虽忧官职，缘干上先有亥水生其官鬼，窃其子息爻。官讼则忌。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　子孙克官鬼，官职、官讼、病占见子息爻旺多不利；若财爻化子生官，则官占可转吉，讼病仍忌。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己巳日　月将 戌 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：子息爻现卦 · 己巳日第9局昼占（据书图三传酉丑巳注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"官鬼爻现卦-自身兄弟有忧\">官鬼爻现卦：自身兄弟有忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">官鬼爻现卦，忧己身及兄弟。歌云：官星鬼贼作三传，本身兄弟不宜占，父母之爻如透出，己身昆仲总安然。如乙丑日干上子，三传巳丑酉金局皆鬼爻，虽忧己身及兄弟，奈干上先有子水生其己身兄弟，窃其官鬼爻也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　官鬼克身与兄弟，官鬼现卦主自身、兄弟有忧；父母爻透出可化鬼生身。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙丑日　月将 寅 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 丑 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：官鬼爻现卦 · 乙丑日第5局昼占（据书图三传巳丑酉注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"同类现卦-妻财有忧\">同类现卦：妻财有忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">同类现卦，必忧妻及失财。歌云：干支同类在传中，钱财耗散及妻凶，支干上神乘子息，妻宫无恙反财丰。如丙寅日干上丑，三传戌午寅皆是日之同类，虽忧妻位及损耗钱财，赖干上先有丑土生其财爻，窃其比肩。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　同类兄弟克妻财，现于课传主破财或妻忧；若子孙爻化兄弟生财，则可解。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：同类现卦 · 丙寅日第5局昼占（据书图三传戌午寅注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"三传内现类而传自墓克者-现类无气\">三传内现类而传自墓克者：现类无气</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">三传内现类而传自墓克者例，皆是午丑申作三传。如乙亥、乙酉、乙未、乙巳、乙卯五日，并午加亥为用，如有官人占之，不可得官；如常人占之，反宜消除灾祸，缘末传申金为官鬼，被初传午火所克，又被中传丑来墓申，兼末之申金自坐于丑墓之上，其申金全无气象。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传虽现所占类神，但该类神被克、被墓、自坐墓上，则类神无气。官人占官不利，常人占消灾反吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙亥日　月将 丑 加占时 午　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 丑 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：三传内现类而传自墓克者 · 乙亥日第6局昼占（据书图三传午丑申注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支干同类格-求财难得\">支干同类格：求财难得</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">支干同类格，难求财，缘支干各相争夺。惟有十二日：甲寅、乙卯、庚申、辛酉、丙午、丁巳、壬子、癸亥、己丑、己未、戊辰、戊戌。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支干同类，彼此争夺，求财难得。书列十二日有此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲寅日　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 巳 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：支干同类格 · 甲寅日第1局昼占（据书图三传寅巳申注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"白蚁食尸格-墓中生白蚁\">白蚁食尸格：墓中生白蚁</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">白蚁食尸格，壬癸日申坐辰上，夜将上乘白虎，此用父母爻乘白虎坐墓，必父母墓中生白蚁，或兴祸端。如父母在，主病灾；更作月内死气、死神，占父母病必死。又戊日午加戌，昼将上乘白虎；六己日巳坐戌，昼将上乘白虎，皆如前说。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　父母爻乘白虎坐墓，主祖墓、父母、尊长类有灾；父母在则应病灾，兼死气死神更凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸未日　月将 辰 加占时 酉　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 戌 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>午→丑→申</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>卯→戌→巳</strong>（重审；分歧类型：<strong>待查</strong>）。 原书注：白蚁食尸格 · 癸未日第6局夜占（据书图三传午丑申注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"懒去取财格-退缩后悔\">懒去取财格：退缩后悔</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">懒去取财格，六甲日干上寅或卯，纵传内见财爻。如求财，必心多退悔，懒去取财，恐争夺也。余日逐类看所乘何神而言其事类。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上同类旺，虽传内见财，也多退缩后悔，怕争夺而懒于取财。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"德丧禄绝格-阳日返吟\">德丧禄绝格：阳日返吟</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">德丧禄绝格，阳日返吟，阴日四绝体。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 95 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　阳日返吟为德丧禄绝，阴日返吟为四绝体，多不利吉事进取。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：三传现某六亲，须防其所克之亲受灾</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传现某一六亲爻。</p>\n<p>⭐ 须防其所克之亲受灾：财现忧父母、父母现忧子息、子息现忧官事、官鬼现忧己身兄弟、同类现忧妻财；干上先有化神则无忧。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔类神主次〕</span>六爻现卦：六亲类神都可在课传显现，应防问事类神受克。　<strong>用法</strong>：官人求官忌子孙制官；常人占病讼反喜子孙制鬼。</p>\n<hr>", "bf96": "<h2 id=\"第-96-法-旬内空亡逐类推-详辨多端\">第 96 法　旬内空亡逐类推：详辨多端</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　财空军储乏，鬼空敌人遁，救空谋策拙，比空赞佐情，生空防失惠</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"类神空亡格-六亲空亡\">类神空亡格：六亲空亡</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">甲子旬戌亥空亡。甲子、乙丑日妻财及父母空；丙寅、丁卯日子息及官鬼空；戊辰、己巳日兄弟及妻财空；庚午、辛未日父母及子息空；壬申、癸酉日官鬼及兄弟空。其余五旬以此类推。十恶大败日乃无禄之日也，盖甲辰、乙巳、壬申、丙申、丁亥、庚辰、戊戌、癸亥、辛巳、己丑，此十日禄神空亡，故为无禄之日。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 96 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　旬空要按日干六亲逐类推断。财空主财乏，鬼空主官鬼无力，救空主谋策不灵，比空主助力不足，生空主恩惠失落；十恶大败日以禄神空亡为要。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：按旬空所落六亲逐类推断吉凶得失</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　按本旬空亡所落之六亲。</p>\n<p>⭐ 逐类推断（财空军储乏、鬼空敌人遁、救空谋策拙、比空赞佐慵、生空防失惠）；十恶大败日禄神空亡。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔空亡虚实〕</span>旬内空亡逐类：同一空亡地支，对不同日干可分别为财、官、父、兄、子。　<strong>用法</strong>：不可只说“某支空”，要明确空的是哪一类人事。</p>\n<hr>", "bf97": "<h2 id=\"第-97-法-所筮不入仍凭类-一辨类神\">第 97 法　所筮不入仍凭类：一辨类神</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　所占万类皆如其法</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"类神之理一-以类神作推断\">类神之理一：以类神作推断</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如占失脱，虽玄武并脱气、日鬼不在六处，亦宜用此类而言其方所、色目也。余所占万类皆如其法。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 97 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　所占之事即使类神不入课传，也仍要凭类神断方所、色目、吉凶。失脱以玄武、脱气、日鬼等类神推之，其他万类仿此。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：所占之象不入六处，仍凭类神断方所色目</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　所占之象不入四课三传六处。</p>\n<p>⭐ 仍凭其类神断其方所、色目，万类皆如其法。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔类神主次〕</span>所筮仍凭类：问事类神即使不入四课三传，仍可在天地盘上寻其落处。　<strong>用法</strong>：占失脱仍寻玄武、盗气、日鬼所临；其他问事类推。</p>\n<hr>", "bf98": "<h2 id=\"第-98-法-非占现类勿言之-再辨类神\">第 98 法　非占现类勿言之：再辨类神</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　凡行师之日，以干为三军，支为营寨</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"类神之理二-占事各凭类神\">类神之理二：占事各凭类神</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如前贤有诸秘法，用之极灵。且如白虎临寅在支上发用者，必宅中有栋折木崩之惊，斯法极验。设有占课君子问求财事，卜得此课，切不可言其梁栋挫折，大抵与求财异。如此条贯犯之极多，时人不可不为自警。举此一法，其余可知。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 98 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　不是所占事项的类神，即使现于课传，也不要牵强断入。占财不应妄断宅中梁折，类神必须与所问之事相应。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：盘现之象非所占事类，不可妄言</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　盘中所现之象非本次所占之事类。</p>\n<p>⭐ 不可妄言（如问求财不可言梁栋摧折），时人不可不自警。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔类神主次〕</span>非占现类勿言：不是所问事的类神，即使显于课传，也不宜牵强断入。　<strong>用法</strong>：问财不因白虎就断病，问病不因青龙就断财；始终围绕来意。</p>\n<hr>", "bf99": "<h2 id=\"第-99-法-常问不应逢吉象-详辨富贵\">第 99 法　常问不应逢吉象：详辨富贵</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　贵课利贵人不利小人，太平时虽有破敌之策而无所用之日</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"贵课的推断-以占者身份定吉凶\">贵课的推断：以占者身份定吉凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">诸龙德、铸印、高盖乘轩、斫轮、官爵、富贵、三光、三奇、三阳之吉泰卦，但有官君子占之则为吉兆，或迁官转职，或面君而奏事也。如常人占得上项吉卦，恐致灾祸临身，大难相压，盖常流百姓既不事贵，兼以本身无官无禄，岂宜占得面君及见贵之卦乎。必因讼而名达朝廷，不然必到讼庭，面见太守而遭罪。占病必见阴司，如得远干出外，可免病讼。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 99 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　富贵吉课要看占者身份。官贵占之主升迁奏事；常人占得反可能因讼见官、因病见阴司。吉象不合身份，反成不应之凶。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：常人占逢贵课吉象反恐致灾，宜远出免祸</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　常人所问却逢诸贵德吉泰之课。</p>\n<p>⭐ 官君子占为吉兆（迁官面君）；常人占反恐致灾（因讼达朝廷、见太守遭罪），远出可免病讼。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔问事语境〕</span>常问不应吉象：日常小事遇过大富贵吉象，吉应往往降级，不会无故飞跃。　<strong>用法</strong>：象的大小要与问题层级、占人身份相称。</p>\n<hr>", "bf100": "<h2 id=\"第-100-法-已灾凶逃返无疑-详辨有无\">第 100 法　已灾凶逃返无疑：详辨有无</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占凶者却吉，占吉者却凶</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"凶课的推断-以事情发生与否论吉凶\">凶课的推断：以事情发生与否论吉凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">凡值丧魂、魄化、天祸、天灾、伏殃、天狱、天网四张、天地二烦诸凶卦，如已见病讼灾祸，之后占得前项凶卦，其灾却可消除，不足为虑。如未见病讼之前占得此者，必病讼灾祸并至，更无疑也。至天罡之神临身命行年，静者主动，动者主静，如占讼入狱者即出狱也。其余占凶者却吉，占吉者却凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 100 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　大凶课要看灾祸是否已发生。已在病讼灾中再见凶课，反主灾消；未有灾而先见凶课，则病讼灾祸将至。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"结绝格-凶事完结\">结绝格：凶事完结</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">结绝格，六丙日干上亥，或常问必主病讼。如已见凶灾，反宜结绝旧事；又作昼贵，尤宜告贵人而结绝凶事。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 100 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　六丙日干上亥，常问主病讼；若已有凶灾，则宜借贵人之力结绝旧事。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日　月将 子 加占时 午　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 子 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>亥→巳→亥</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>午→子→午</strong>（返吟；分歧类型：<strong>待查</strong>）。 原书注：结绝格 · 六丙日干上亥，昼贵宜告贵结绝凶事 · 丙子日第7局昼占（据原文例课三传亥巳亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"以凶制凶格-宜于解忧\">以凶制凶格：宜于解忧</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">以凶制凶格，六癸日辰加丑，此用墓神敌克日，诚为凶也。如夜将又乘蛇尤凶，以末上戌乘白虎冲辰，谓之破墓冲鬼，以凶制凶，凶即散而无从也。又六癸日辰加丑昼将，亦赖末之蛇冲虎，辰冲戌，尤宜解忧。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 100 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　凶神被另一凶神冲破制伏，为以凶制凶。虽课象凶，若已有忧灾，反宜解忧散凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸未日　月将 酉 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 未 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：以凶制凶格 · 六癸日辰加丑，破墓冲鬼 · 癸未日第10局昼占（据原文例课三传辰未戌注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（总纲）：凶否卦已灾后占则灾消、未灾前占则祸至</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　已见病讼灾迍之后，占得凶否之卦（丧魂/天祸/天网等）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 灾可消除；若未灾之前占得则病讼丧祸并至。天罡临命行年，静者主动、动者主静。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔问事语境〕</span>已灾凶逃：凶灾已经发生后再占，课中凶象可为已应，不必再断一次。　<strong>用法</strong>：要区分“将发”与“已应”；凶神退、空、入墓可主灾后渐解。</p>\n<hr>\n<hr>"});